<title>FRANCE: ABN Amro named French bond primary dealer.</title>
<headline>ABN Amro named French bond primary dealer.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French finance ministry said on Thursday it had awarded primary dealer status (SVT) for French government debt to ABN Amro Finance.</p>
<p>It said the next selection of French primary dealers would be at the beginning of 1998.</p>
<p>ABN Amro was made a correspondant dealer, or CVT, in October 1995.</p>
</text>
